OdinsRefugeCal:
	'''
	Grants the Holy Mantle's blocking effect
	Grants immunity to knockback
	Double tap a direction or press the dash key to perform a long dash of 20 tiles
	The dash passes through enemies, dealing 1000 base damage and granting 12 frames of invincibility on impact
	The impact creates a 300 base damage explosion and inflicts God Slayer Inferno for 5 seconds
	Dashing again takes 0.5 seconds after the dash ends
	Increases invincibility time after taking a hit
	The lower your health, the more extra invincibility frames you gain on hit, up to 30
	Taking more than 200 damage in one hit grants 30 additional invincibility frames
	Taking a hit briefly increases your movement speed
	Taking a hit grants the Honey buff for 5 seconds
	Taking a hit rains 12 falling stars that deal 130 base damage
	Below 50% life, gain an Ice Barrier
	Grants a Paladin's Shield that shares damage taken by teammates
	'''
